cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or protocol, please cite the companion article
  (preferred) and, optionally, this software repository.
type: software
title: >-
  Leakage-Controlled Concept Graph Construction and Cold-Start Diagnostic
  Protocol for Knowledge Tracing (companion code)
abstract: >-
  Companion code for a leakage-controlled audit protocol for
  knowledge-component graph construction in graph-enhanced knowledge tracing.
  The repository provides train-only fold-aware graph construction, DAG audit,
  leakage diagnostics, cold-start stratification, DDR probes, controlled
  leak injection, and paper artefact generation. It is not a new SOTA KT
  backbone.
